#Протокол_Agent_Worker_Adapter<[
Базис:
  Work Graph является операционной моделью задач, статусов, evidence и решений.
  Cursor SDK, Claude SDK/API, OpenAI-compatible endpoint и локальный runner являются исполнителями, а не владельцами business state.
  Provider session может хранить только временный run context; source of truth остаётся в .bvc/Work Graph.
Вектор:
  Agent worker adapter claims одну WorkItem task, строит provider prompt/context из snapshot и policy, запускает provider run и возвращает структурированный результат.
  Adapter не меняет Work Graph напрямую: он предлагает status transition request, evidence и patch summary, а Work Graph runtime применяет policy gates.
  Повторный запуск всегда строится из текущего Work Graph snapshot, а не из скрытой истории provider session.
Цель:
  Любой agent provider можно заменить без изменения Work Graph runtime, evidence policy и operator dashboard.

Проверки:
  provider ограничен ролью executor adapter
  вход и выход worker-а описаны без Cursor-only полей
  failure/retry/cancel не зависят от скрытого session state

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: agent-worker-adapter
  work.source: design-agent-worker-adapter
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Контракт_Worker_Input_V1<[
Базис:
  Worker должен получать только тот контекст, который можно восстановить из Work Graph, memory и policy.
Вектор:
  Conceptual payload: schema, runId, task snapshot, memorySlice, allowedTools, targetFiles, policy and providerHints.
  task включает id, title, status, checks, evidence, dependsOn, targetFiles, traceStatus и nextAction.
  policy включает toolPolicy, security boundary, status gates, verification commands, timeout and cancellation limits.
  providerHints включает budget и required capabilities, но не является business state.
Цель:
  Worker run можно воспроизвести, отменить или повторить из наблюдаемого состояния Work Graph.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: agent-worker-input-v1
  protocol.id: agent-worker-adapter
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Контракт_Worker_Output_V1<[
Базис:
  Provider может отвечать текстом, tool calls, patches или logs, но Work Graph должен получать единый результат.
Вектор:
  Conceptual payload: schema, runId, taskId, status, patchSummary, evidence, transitionRequest, logs, failureReason and retryAdvice.
  status принимает succeeded, failed, cancelled или needs_human.
  transitionRequest просит verify, done, blocked или ready; Work Graph runtime решает, допустим ли переход.
  evidence должно быть достаточным для gates и operator review без replay provider session.
Цель:
  Runtime can record evidence, apply transition policy and show operator-readable history without provider-specific parsing.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: agent-worker-output-v1
  protocol.id: agent-worker-adapter
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Матрица_Provider_Capabilities<[
Базис:
  Первый adapter contract должен выбрать provider по capability и policy fit, а не по бренду SDK.
Вектор:
  Cursor SDK: IDE-local file context, native tool use and user-visible workspace actions; vendor coupling is contained by neutral input/output.
  Claude SDK/API: strong reasoning, tool-use flows and long context variants; task state and evidence stay externalized.
  OpenAI-compatible endpoint: hosted or proxy models through chat/tool-call compatibility; requires verified JSON/tool_call behavior and timeout handling.
  Local CLI/runner: deterministic scripts, local LLMs, smoke tests and offline execution; requires explicit sandbox, stdout/stderr capture and bounded command policy.
  Selection criteria: required tools, structured output quality, timeout/cancel support, logs/evidence access, security fit, context budget, cost and deterministic retry path.
Цель:
  Scheduler can select the cheapest safe provider that satisfies task capability requirements and fall back predictably.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  decision.id: agent-worker-provider-capabilities
  protocol.id: agent-worker-adapter
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Жизненный_Цикл_Worker_Run<[
Базис:
  Work Graph state transitions must remain observable and policy-gated.
Вектор:
  Lifecycle: claim task; build task snapshot, memory slice, tools, target files and policy; select provider; run with bounded permissions; collect patch summary, evidence, logs and failure reason; validate output; request transition; let Work Graph runtime record evidence and apply policy.
  Adapter never silently marks done and never mutates source-of-truth files outside declared tools.
Цель:
  Agent execution becomes a repeatable Work Graph operation instead of an opaque chat session.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  protocol.id: agent-worker-lifecycle
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Семантика_Failure_Retry_Cancel<[
Базис:
  Failure semantics must not be hidden in SDK sessions or chat history.
Вектор:
  Failed run returns failed with failureReason, logs and retryAdvice; Work Graph may stay claimed, move to blocked, or return to ready by explicit transition.
  Retry starts from fresh Work Graph snapshot and prior evidence/log summaries, not provider conversation memory.
  Cancellation returns cancelled with partial evidence and no implicit status change except an explicit transition request.
  Repeated failures should add visible evidence or blocker reason before another automatic retry.
Цель:
  Operator and scheduler can understand whether to retry, narrow scope, switch provider or ask for human input.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: agent-worker-failure-retry-cancel
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Граница_Security_Tool_Policy<[
Базис:
  Provider must only execute capabilities granted by Work Graph runtime and operator policy.
Вектор:
  Tool policy is deny-by-default outside targetFiles and declared commands.
  Secret material is never copied into provider prompts unless explicitly allowed by policy.
  Network, shell, file write and destructive actions require separate capability flags.
  Provider logs are evidence artifacts, but may be redacted before storage.
Цель:
  Provider neutrality does not weaken workspace safety or evidence quality.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: agent-worker-security-tool-policy
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Правила_Provider_Selection_Fallback<[
Базис:
  Provider choice should be deterministic enough for audit and flexible enough for local development.
Вектор:
  Select provider by task-required capabilities first, then policy compatibility, then reliability, cost and latency.
  Prefer local CLI/runner for deterministic verification and smoke tasks.
  Prefer provider with native tool calls for file-changing agent tasks.
  Fall back only when output contract validation fails, provider is unavailable, timeout occurs, or policy denies a required capability.
  Fallback records evidence that includes previous provider, failure class and reason for switching.
Цель:
  Provider replacement is visible, bounded and explainable through Work Graph evidence.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  decision.id: agent-worker-provider-selection-fallback
  protocol.id: agent-worker-adapter
  trace.status: verified
]>
